Z||000008||Cyberkhat||11-28-2001||06:20 PM||||I just looked at a 88 formula with radial T/A's on it and I thought it looked sharp.(see 21 fiero's for sale thread) This was with the lace wheels which I also have. I think i'm going to go with the letters.It's kind of old school but its my car so deal with it ,right?||||reg||1
