Z||000016||rogergarrison||11-28-2001||07:38 PM||||imo, white letters belong on 60's & 70's muscle cars. Not sports cars. even though I do see them on vettes, when have you seen a porsche, mercedes, lambo, lotus or ferrari with white letter tires. They look great on Roadrunners, early camaros+ mustangs, 442's, GTOs......... but always do what you want, its your car.||||reg||1
